      "content": "The transcript detail suggests a potential cultural mismatch where his strengths conflict with your environment's pace. If \"documentation\" and \"consensus-building\" are antithetical to your immediate, high-velocity sprint needs, then hesitation is warranted. Before cutting him, consider if those traits could be reframed as risk mitigation rather than slowing down, but if rapid, autonomous execution is non-negotiable, he may be a liability.",
